\f1\fs26 With his account drained and his brain steeped in fermenting cactus juice, Emil staggered out into the toxic cold of the night. The air smelled like boiled cabbage, wet cats, and fried underwear. He\'92d have to contact Agent Jones, but then was not the best time. He was incoherent, and would need his wits about him when apologising for the delay. It would be better if Agent Jones never knew he got drunk.\
\'93I\'92m sorry, Agent Jones,\'94 he rehearsed, and got no farther before he giggled. \'93Hello, I\'92m Special Agent Ajent Jones,\'94 he parodied. \'93I\'92m Ajent Jones \'85 Agent Ajent \'85\'94 He sputtered into laughter, then recomposed his impersonation. \'93I\'92m a stupid Special Agent, whose first name is also Ajent.\'94 Racks of laughter seized him.\
That\'92s when Emil dropped dead. It wasn\'92t as quick or clean as Special Agent Jones promised. An anonymous sniper hadn\'92t taken him out. Neither had his malignant sperm rocks. Emil died of a heart attack.
